```
- **R8-CORR-002** (extras-parking): prior-entry detection runs outside restore-mode guard, emitting spurious contradiction message. **APPLIES TO 024B-EXTRAS** — ensure restore-mode guard scoping is tight.
```
This was the carry-forward at parking time. The fix has long since landed (`prior_restore_evidence_present()` is called only inside `check_forward_mode_safety()`, which is guarded by `RESTORE_MODE=0`). Status needs update.

**Fix:** Change `**APPLIES TO 024B-EXTRAS** — ensure restore-mode guard scoping is tight.` to `**CLOSED in 024B-extras** — prior_restore_evidence_present() is called only inside check_forward_mode_safety() which is guarded by RESTORE_MODE=0 (closure verified in R22 + R25 + R27 reviews).`

